<TD class=xl65 style="BORDER-TOP: #f0f0f0; HEIGHT: 18.75pt; BORDER-RIGHT: #f0f0f0; WIDTH: 648pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.5pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #f0f0f0; BACKGROUND-COLOR: transparent" height=25 width=862 colSpan=11><FONT size=3 face=宋体>绍兴一中2021年重点工作计划清单（共93项）</FONT></TD></TR>
